{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本男神雲集台灣，除了日劇天王木村拓哉一連兩日在台北開騷外，另一男神山下智久昨日(14日亦於高雄舉行相隔15年的台灣演唱會。</p><p>前日(13日)，他抵達當地，便吸引大批熱情粉絲接機。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;與山下十分老友的台灣</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:15:19.493715+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T03:34:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T04:08:37.691438+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:08:37.691438+00:00","content_hash":"6cd0825da646260b34246ce509256c18bdf384856fe17283b2cb217aebf1d8b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}